# Firmware stand-ins for the hantek-dso model (emu/src/models/hantek-dso.rs):
# the files the driver uploads to the five emulated profiles. The sizes
# are the model's PROFILES, which a unit test checks; the real files
# (extracted from Hantek's Windows driver) are not available here, and the
# model checks the stand-in byte for byte.
hantek-dso-2090.fw 5642
hantek-dso-2150.fw 5714
hantek-dso-2250.fw 6890
hantek-dso-5200.fw 7024
hantek-dso-5200A.fw 7120
